# Local agent/tooling caches — never commit these.
# .fastembed_cache holds ~146 MB of ONNX model blobs and appears in three
# places (repo root, docker/, kubernetes/) depending on where a tool was run.
# A plain `git add -A` picks all of it up.
.fastembed_cache/
**/.fastembed_cache/
.bg-shell/
